  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": {
        "pt": "Como ler",
        "en": "Reading"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "pt": "Colunas e tipos como o SQLite os registra depois de rodar as migrations (PRAGMA table_info). Em MySQL ou PostgreSQL, a mesma migration gera os tipos nativos.",
          "en": "Columns and types as SQLite records them after migrations (PRAGMA table_info). In MySQL or PostgreSQL, the same migration creates native types."
        },
        {
          "pt": "NN = NOT NULL. Sem NN, a coluna aceita nulo.",
          "en": "NN = NOT NULL. Without NN, null is allowed."
        },
        {
          "pt": "PK, FK e UK marcam cada coluna. PK ou UK em mais de uma coluna da mesma tabela pode ser uma chave composta: veja o card \"Chaves compostas\".",
          "en": "PK, FK and UK mark each column. PK or UK on several columns in one table may be a composite key: see the \"Composite keys\" card."
        },
        {
          "pt": "O rótulo de cada ligação é a regra ON DELETE da chave estrangeira. Linha tracejada: a FK não faz parte da PK da tabela filha.",
          "en": "Each link label is the foreign key's ON DELETE rule. Dashed line: the FK is not part of the child table's PK."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": {
        "pt": "Chaves compostas",
        "en": "Composite keys"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "pt": "onboarding_flow_progress: único (flow_id, subject_type, subject_id, scope_type, scope_id)",
          "en": "onboarding_flow_progress: unique (flow_id, subject_type, subject_id, scope_type, scope_id)"
        },
        {
          "pt": "onboarding_steps: único (flow_id, key)",
          "en": "onboarding_steps: unique (flow_id, key)"
        },
        {
          "pt": "onboarding_preferences: único (subject_type, subject_id, scope_type, scope_id)",
          "en": "onboarding_preferences: unique (subject_type, subject_id, scope_type, scope_id)"
        },
        {
          "pt": "onboarding_step_progress: único (step_id, subject_type, subject_id, scope_type, scope_id)",
          "en": "onboarding_step_progress: unique (step_id, subject_type, subject_id, scope_type, scope_id)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": {
        "pt": "Referências sem chave estrangeira",
        "en": "References without foreign keys"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "pt": "O banco não tem chave estrangeira para estas colunas, por isso elas não ganham linha. Os pares *_type/*_id são relações polimórficas.",
          "en": "Database has no foreign keys for these columns, so they have no lines. *_type/*_id pairs are polymorphic relations."
        },
        {
          "pt": "onboarding_flow_progress: subject_type/subject_id e scope_type/scope_id",
          "en": "onboarding_flow_progress: subject_type/subject_id and scope_type/scope_id"
        },
        {
          "pt": "onboarding_preferences: subject_type/subject_id e scope_type/scope_id",
          "en": "onboarding_preferences: subject_type/subject_id and scope_type/scope_id"
        },
        {
          "pt": "onboarding_step_progress: subject_type/subject_id e scope_type/scope_id",
          "en": "onboarding_step_progress: subject_type/subject_id and scope_type/scope_id"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": {
        "pt": "Outras migrations",
        "en": "Other migrations"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "pt": "onboarding_flow_progress e onboarding_step_progress: scope_type e scope_id passam a NOT NULL (harden_onboarding_progress_scope).",
          "en": "onboarding_flow_progress and onboarding_step_progress: scope_type and scope_id become NOT NULL (harden_onboarding_progress_scope)."
        },
        "onboarding_flows: visibility_condition (add_visibility_to_onboarding).",
        {
          "pt": "onboarding_steps: media_type, media_source, media_disk, media_path, media_url, media_caption, modal_position e video_completion_threshold (add_media_to_onboarding_steps) e visibility_condition (add_visibility_to_onboarding).",
          "en": "onboarding_steps: media_type, media_source, media_disk, media_path, media_url, media_caption, modal_position and video_completion_threshold (add_media_to_onboarding_steps) and visibility_condition (add_visibility_to_onboarding)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": {
        "pt": "Evidência",
        "en": "Evidence"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "pt": "Cada tabela leva à linha da migration que a cria.",
          "en": "Each table links to its creation migration line."
        },
        {
          "pt": "As colunas que outras migrations acrescentam ou tiram estão no card \"Outras migrations\".",
          "en": "Columns added or removed by other migrations are in the \"Other migrations\" card."
        },
        {
          "pt": "Cada ligação leva à linha da chave estrangeira, nos cards \"Prova das ligações\".",
          "en": "Each link leads to the foreign key line in the \"Link evidence\" cards."
        }
      ]
